edit_instructions.replacement_text:
```css
/* Simultaneous animations — all start together */
.hero-title {
  animation: fadeInUp 600ms ease-out;
}

.hero-subtitle {
  animation: fadeInUp 600ms ease-out 0ms; /* no delay */
}

.hero-cta {
  animation: fadeInUp 600ms ease-out 0ms; /* no emphasis on CTA */
}

/* Active background competes for attention */
.background-element {
  animation: pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  opacity: 0.8;
}
```

